<question type="calculated">
<name><text>S1 VAT gross price</text></name>
<questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>A tune-up costs €{net} net. VAT is 19&nbsp;%. What is the gross price in euros? Round to cents.</p>]]></text></questiontext>
<generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Gross = net × 1.19. See the chapter <em>Percentages</em>.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
