<question type="calculated">
<name><text>S1 Net from gross</text></name>
<questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>A customer paid €{gross} including 19&nbsp;% VAT. What is the net price in euros? Round to cents.</p>]]></text></questiontext>
