<question type="calculated">
<name><text>S1 Two price changes</text></name>
<questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>A price rises by {up}&nbsp;% and later falls by {down}&nbsp;%. By how many percent has it changed in total? Give a percentage (negative for a fall), rounded to two decimals, without the % sign.</p>]]></text></questiontext>
<generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Multiply the growth factors: (1 + up) × (1 − down), then subtract 1.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
