<name><text>S1 Average growth rate</text></name>
<questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Sales grew from €{start} to €{end} in {n} years. What was the average growth rate per year in percent? Round to two decimals, without the % sign.</p>]]></text></questiontext>
<generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Average growth rate = (end ÷ start)<sup>1/n</sup> − 1.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
